---
import { consultingUrl, productUrl } from '../lib/site-links';
---
<section id="field-notes" class="field-notes-preview">
  <div class="notes-inner">
    <p class="notes-eyebrow">From our research & client work</p>
    <h2>Start with a question<br />you recognise.</h2>
    <p class="notes-intro">A useful place to begin. Open to read and share.</p>
    <div class="notes-grid">
      <a href={`${productUrl}/field-notes/which-document-can-you-trust/`}><span class="notes-number">01 / Documents</span><h3>Which document<br />can we trust?</h3><p>Finding the file is only the beginning. Check its status, source and what changed.</p><span class="notes-read">Read the field note ↗</span></a>
      <a href={`${productUrl}/field-notes/what-should-ai-handle/`}><span class="notes-number">02 / AI & people</span><h3>What should AI handle?</h3><p>Separate the preparation from the decisions that need your people’s judgment.</p><span class="notes-read">Read the field note ↗</span></a>
      <a href={`${consultingUrl}/work/cornerstone/`}><span class="notes-number">03 / A real example</span><h3>Why enter the same information twice?</h3><p>Business records, a public website and marketing feedback, connected.</p><span class="notes-read">Explore the client work ↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.field-notes-preview{background:#2b2d31;color:#efeff0;padding:76px 32px;border-block:1px solid #ffffff24;}
.notes-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;}
.notes-eyebrow{font-size:.875rem;color:#d6bb90;margin:0 0 18px!important;}
.field-notes-preview h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 20px!important;}
.notes-intro{color:#c9cace;line-height:1.7;}
.notes-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px;margin-top:36px;}
.notes-grid>a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-top:1px solid #74706a;padding:24px 0 12px;}
.notes-number{font-size:.875rem;color:#d6bb90;}
.notes-grid h3{font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1.25;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:20px 0 16px!important;}
.notes-grid p{color:#c9cace;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 24px!important;}
.notes-read{margin-top:auto;color:#d6bb90;font-size:.9375rem;}
.notes-grid>a:hover .notes-read{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;}
.notes-grid>a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #d6bb90;outline-offset:7px;}
@media(max-width:700px){.field-notes-preview{padding:52px 22px;}.notes-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;}.notes-grid h3{margin:14px 0!important;}}
</style>

